// Ouroboros, the Endless Loop (docs/NewEnemies.md, stage 1). Each turn it shows a `break` guard, a real condition on
// the volley you land. Meet it and the loop breaks: its counter resets, it is stunned, and that program deals +50%.
// Miss it and the Loop goes around once more: one more hit next time. The lesson: every loop needs a reachable exit.
